### Quick Checklist Before Launch

- [ ] All core features implemented and tested.  
- [ ] Responsive design passes on mobile, tablet, desktop.  
- [ ] Lighthouse score ≥ 90 (performance, accessibility, best practices).  
- [ ] Payment flow fully integrated and PCI‑DSS compliant.  
- [ ] Analytics & error monitoring set up.  
- [ ] Deployment pipeline automated.  
- [ ] Documentation for developers & designers.  

---

**That’s it!**  
Follow this roadmap, adapt the stack to your team’s strengths, and you’ll have a clean, maintainable, and scalable frontend for your e‑commerce site in no time. Happy coding! 🚀
